lns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mroot><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mroot><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mroot><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the inverse function is \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"219\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em; margin-left: 0.053em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c c